  "notes": "A weight-stationary systolic array translated from the Chisel source of an open-source spatial-array generator (its BSD-style licence notice, the source commit and files, and every change are in the file header; not endorsed by the generator's authors). An N x N mesh of PEs with two weight registers each: a preload pass shifts B in, last row first, then a compute pass streams A; the skew lanes are packed as triangles, and valid and propagate are kept once per anti-diagonal. Latency 4N + 1 (17 at N = 4).",
